# Moment of Truth (battlefield.moment_of_truth#helper, Jade Sepulcher): bob (completed) and dan (accepted, Prog 5) enter
# with the main char; cat (accepted, Prog 2) and eve (no quest) are each refused with only the entry NPC's default
# 32767 (DefaultActions.lua): neither gets the framework's NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7377. The 32001 packets carry the skip
# flag 0 for main and dan and 1 for bob, and the ninth argument 2. The finish runs the quest's 32001
# (MomentOfTruth.cs): main's Prog 4 -> 5. dan's finish (Prog 5) changes nothing.
lists JadeSepulcher/_1v0/onTrigger JadeSepulcher/onEventUpdate/32000 JadeSepulcher/onEventFinish/32000 JadeSepulcher/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char eve zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.MomentOfTruth accepted
charvar Quest[6][30]Prog 4
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.MomentOfTruth completed
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.MomentOfTruth accepted
cat: charvar Quest[6][30]Prog 2
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.MomentOfTruth accepted
dan: charvar Quest[6][30]Prog 5
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _1v0
update 32000 option=49
finish
bob: trigger _1v0
bob: update 32000 option=49
bob: finish
cat: trigger _1v0
cat: update 32000 option=49
cat: finish
dan: trigger _1v0
dan: update 32000 option=49
dan: finish
eve: trigger _1v0
eve: update 32000 option=49
eve: finish
kill SHADOWHAND_KAJEEL_JA
kill SHADOWHAND_KAJEEL_JA+1
kill SHADOWHAND_KAJEEL_JA+2
kill SHADOWHAND_KAJEEL_JA+3
kill SHADOWHAND_KAJEEL_JA+4
kill SHADOWHAND_KAJEEL_JA+5
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
